      "content": "No, anyone asked to lie about legal constraints would face immediate discrediting and damage the campaign permanently. Instead, you must admit the specific budget was rejected as a matter of fiscal responsibility while immediately pivoting to the班子's commitment to future funding for the center. If the truth is that he simply disagreed with the initial budget, frame it as ensuring resources were used for their highest impact first. Acknowledging the specific disagreement honestly, without inventing false legal constraints, will preserve trust more effectively than any fabrication.",
